  "description": "CAMELS (Catchment Attributes and MEteorology for Large-sample Studies) as downloaded by `_shared/scripts/download_raw.sh camels` from Zenodo record 15529996: time series v1.2 and catchment attributes v2.0 for 671 minimally disturbed CONUS basins of the USGS HCDN-2009 network. `basin_timeseries_v1p2_metForcing_obsFlow.zip` holds daily basin-mean forcings from Daymet and NLDAS (1980-2014) and Maurer (1980-2008), observed USGS streamflow, basin metadata and simplified basin shapefiles; the three `modelOutput` zips hold SNOW-17 / SAC-SMA simulations per forcing; `basin_set_full_res.zip` holds full-resolution basin boundaries; the `camels_*.txt` files are semicolon-delimited attribute tables keyed by `gauge_id`. Read-only.",
